	(text_box "1. Function: JP1/JP2 connect the on-board LT3582-12 outputs to the stimulation LDO inputs. Cut both to feed STIM_PRE_POS/NEG from a bench supply on TP38/TP39 (return: TP36 AGND), as LDO Board A did.\n\n2. Source / changes: Claude design. LDO Board A took INPUT_VDD10/INPUT_VSS10 from outside (Reference/LDO Board A J15/J8). Limits: LT3042 IN <= 20 V, LT3094 IN >= -20 V (ADI data sheets, Absolute Maximum Ratings); keep >= 1.5 V headroom over the +/-8.06 V outputs (V34). Leave U11 unfitted, or its outputs open, when external +/-V is used. Unverified: external source noise. Carrier V7 (Claude, 24 Nov 2026): copied unchanged; TP8/TP9/TP6 -> TP38/TP39/TP36, U1 -> U11."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
